      {
        "id": 117510,
        "name": "phantaskippy",
        "username": "phantaskippy",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/phantaskippy/{size}/1897_2.png",
        "created_at": "2014-09-12T16:14:17.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>You can trace line of sight from any point on your hex to any point on the other hex, so you could use the side that doesn't block Line of Sight for your line.</p><p>Line of sight has to go through hexes, so you can't use the vertex itself as the line when the hexes don't allow line of sight.</p>",
